  "prerequisite": "Fighting Style Feature",
  "repeatable": false,
  "rulesText": "Fighting Style Feat (Prerequisite: Fighting Style Feature)\n\nWhen you roll damage for an attack you make with a Melee weapon that you are holding with two hands, you can treat any 1 or 2 on a damage die as a 3. The weapon must have the Two-Handed or Versatile property to gain this benefit."
